              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA oreghorieghe na Jeremia aighu ya kuoma kwa isanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA waghora huwu aighu ya awa wandu: “Wadakunda tu kumara-mara, hata ndewikumaziriagha weni; kwa huwo BWANA ndewirumirie, nao uchaghikumbuka mawiwi ghawo na kuwikaba kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a rawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ukanizera, “Kusakewilombia awa wandu wei wiwone mecha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata wikafunga tumu, sichaasikira kililo chawo; hata wikafunya vizongona vekora na vizongona va viro, sichaawirumiria anduangi; ela nichawibwagha wudenyi, na kwa njala, na kwa saka izamie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ngaghamba, “Ee Bwana MLUNGU, ola awo walodi wadawizera awa wandu wei ndewichaabwaghwa wudenyi kungi, hata kwa njala; kedi wei kwalaghirie sere ichakaia andenyi ya isanga jedu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela BWANA ukatumbulia, “Awo walodi waawuyaghora tee kwa irina japo; siwidumie kungi, hata siwilaghirie angu kudedanya nawo hata ilagho jimweri. Mawono wawuyaghighora ndeghifumie kwapo; malodi ghawo ndeghine fwaida weeghidunga weni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa huwo ini BWANA naghora huwu aighu ya walodi awo wilodagha kwa irina japo nisewidumie, wikighora wei ‘Iji isanga ndejichaachelwa ni kifwa cha lufu na njala;’ awo weni wichabwaghwa kwa lufu na njala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na awo wandu wawuyawilodera wichakumbwa achienyi ra Jerusalemu, wibwaghilo ni njala na lufu, wisowe mundu owirika; wichabwaghwa chiaimweri na waka wawo, na wana wawo wa womi na wa waka; angu nichawiwunjira ugho wuwiwi ghwawo aighu kwawo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
